                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759'>NOTE:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759'>1. Wastage (Foodpanda &amp; Vendor) is calculated upon total fraud orders only (in case of Cash Loss &amp; Claim - Refund).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759'>2. Foodpanda Wastage is calculated as per Wastage Project Calculation and Partial amount in case of basket update.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759'>3. Vendor Wastage is calculated as per remaining value of total value after Foodpanda Wastage deduction and Order basket update (Basket update by vendor). </run>
                  </formatted-text>
